# SMART DJ (0.16.21, a settings page after DJ MOVES): the auto-DJ with an energy arc, ears and manners. A 30-minute ARC set from the first piece:
# low energy to begin with (the mood leaning down), a groove that breaks when it has gone stale (not on a count), the next piece chosen to mix
# in (a key near on the circle of fifths); the clock moved to the peak: high energy, less patience; the player playing: it holds back; the
# auto-DJ off: the arc and its mood gone.
seed 0
wait 3000
expect sme 50
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
expect fxpage 36
spin K1 1
spin K2 -1
wait 50
expect fxs100 1
expect fxs101 1
expect fxs102 0
shot smart_page_off.png
tap FX
wait 200
# the auto-DJ (F5) and its new pieces (G5)
press GLO
tapkey 24
tapkey 26
release GLO
expect djon 1
wait 2000
expect sme <40
expect smmin 0
waitfor smmood <0 15000
# no hands: the groove grows stale and breaks on a phrase line, its patience long at this energy (a 30-minute set at 75 % pace: 30 bars)
waitfor sec 1 120000
expect smpace 75
expect smbore >55
# its ears: what the music has, against what it usually has (50 as usual)
expect smhas >30
expect smhas <70
# the breakdown long at this energy, the build, the drop: the piece has had its round; as the groove after it tires, the mix into the
# next (SMART MIX, 0.16.23: a key near, by the journey), and the new piece in
waitfor sec 2 90000
waitfor sec 0 30000
waitfor tx >0 150000
expect smdist >-1
expect smdist <3
waitfor pieceid >0 60000
waitfor tx 0 60000
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
expect fxpage 36
shot smart_page_on.png
tap FX
wait 200
# twenty minutes on: the peak of the arc, little patience
smskip 20
wait 500
expect sme >80
expect smpatience <45
waitfor smmood >0 20000
tap HOME
wait 200
shot smart_perform.png
tap HOME
wait 200
# the player playing (a tap every 3 s for a minute): the groove never grows stale
waitfor sec 1 120000
waitfor sec 0 120000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 3000
expect sec 0
expect smbore <10
# the auto-DJ off: the arc and its mood gone
press GLO
tapkey 24
release GLO
wait 500
expect djon 0
expect sme 50
waitfor smmood 0 15000
